better-screenshot (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New "Copy to Clipboard" switch in the dialog; the file is still saved.
  * Copied images stay on the clipboard after the program exits, through a
    small helper process that quits once something else is copied.

 -- k-nowicki <now.nowicki@gmail.com>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 02:17:54 +0200

better-screenshot (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release, forked from GNOME Screenshot 41.0.
  * Capture a single monitor, chosen from a drop-down and remembered
    between runs by connector name.
  * Save straight to the pictures directory with no preview dialog.
  * New --monitor option taking a monitor number or a connector name.
  * New desktop portal backend, used under Wayland.

 -- k-nowicki <now.nowicki@gmail.com>  Fri, 18 Sep 2026 17:21:33 +0200
